Melee=
Melee is primarily used for [[Ba-Ba]], [[Kephri]], [[Akkha]], and [[Core|Warden's core]], and most bosses in the raid are weakest to [[Stab]]. [[Osmumten's fang]] scales very well with invocation, capable of maintaining high accuracy even against defensive targets. Equipment like the [[Serpentine helm]] can negate venom and poison from the path of Apmeken, Kephri, and [[Zebak]]. [[Moon equipment]] also works well as hybrid armour, benefitting multiple styles. Most bosses can have their defence drained by flat amount, so a [[Bandos godsword]] or sometimes the [[Bone dagger]] are preferable to other defence draining weapons. 
