==Path of Scabaras==
===Challenge room===
To walk the Path of Scabaras, players must test their wits in a series of puzzles. There are five puzzles to complete between two branched paths. While solving the puzzles, [[Scarab (Tombs of Amascut)|scarabs]] will appear from the first two puzzle rooms. These attack with ranged and serve little outside of being a nuisance, so use [[Protect from Missiles]] to block incoming damage. The scarabs' spawn point is the start of the first room, though in larger groups they may move up to the second room.

Players must complete the puzzles in both paths before moving forward. In a solo raid, once the first puzzle is cleared, they must head to the other side (via shortcuts between the rooms), pass the opened door, and then solve the next puzzle there. Solo raiders should always avoid the pillar room, as it involves randomness that on average is far slower to solve than any other puzzle. To skip pillars, path such that you will be solving the room next to it. Once finished, cross over, and proceed.

